## bspwm keybinds & Layout diagram


## Window switch
#
  W+h = focus on Left window
  W+j = focus on Bottom window
  W+k = focus on Top window
  W+l = focus on Right window

  S+W+h = switch window position to Left
  S+W+j = switch window position to Bottom
  S+W+k = switch window position to Top
  S+W+l = switch window position to Right

  S+g = switch active window with the biggest available


## Window resize
#
  W+t = set tile state to window
  W+s = set floating state to window
  W+n = maximize/unmaximize (at tile state) stays under the panel/taskbar
  W+m = fullscreen state (maximize over all)
  	(must set another window state to unmaximize)
	(W+c , W+S+c  breaks fullscreen)

  W+A+h = expand left  border (externally)
  W+A+j = expand lower border (externally)
  W+A+k = expand upper border (externally)
  W+A+l = expand right border (externally)

  C+W+A+h = contract left  border (internally)
  C+W+A+j = contract lower border (internally)
  C+W+A+k = contract upper border (internally)
  C+W+A+l = contract right border (internally)
 
!  W+Up    = shrink window vertically up
!  W+Down  = shrink window vertically down
!  W+Left  = shrink window horizontally left
!  W+Right = shrink window horizontally right


## Desktop switching
#
 W+1 = GoToDesktop 1
 W+2 = GoToDesktop 2
 W-3 = GoToDesktop 3
 
 W+S+1 = SendToDesktop 1
 W+S+2 = SendToDesktop 2 
 W+S+3 = SendToDesktop 3
 

## Programs Shortcuts
#
  W+Enter = Open Terminal (kitty)
  W+e     = Text Editor (Neo Vim)
  W+w     = Web Browser (Brave)
  W+q     = Web Browser (Min)
  W+f	  = File Manager (Thunar)
  W+v     = Pulse Audio Control (pavucontrol-qt)
 
  w+PrintScreen   = Screenshot full screen (using scrot at ~/Pictures)
  W+A+PrintScreen = Screenshot using flamshot (multiple options app)


## Bspc (WM) Shortcuts
#
  W+Space = Rofi programs menu (Drun)
  W+x     = Rofi-power (Reboot/Shutdown/Suspend/Hibernate)
  A-Space = Switch keyboard layout (us,br)  [might use gxkb]

!  A+Escape = Lower 
!  C+W+m    = Move window (n funciona na tela maximizada)
!  A+F4     = Close
  
  W+Esc   = Reload sxhkd config file
  C+W+A+r = Reconfigure openbox  (reload configs)
  W+A+r	  = restart bspwm
  W+A+q	  = quit bspwm
!  W+w	  = close and kill a node


